meta {
  name: Provision Roster
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/swarms/{{swarmId}}/roster
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "agentIds": ["{{agentId}}"]
  }
}

docs {
  Backs core.sp_provision_swarm_roster. Returns { swarmId, rosterSize } — the
  roster's real size after the call, not an added/skipped breakdown (the
  procedure only reports that via a RAISE NOTICE this API can't retrieve,
  deltas/restful.spec.md § Risks #2).

  Invalid/foreign agent ids are silently skipped by the procedure, not
  rejected — re-running with the same ids is safe and idempotent.
}
